{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UNIVERSE SLIME is a destruction action game where everything is destructible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbThe player controls a UNIVERSE SLIME, a remnant of a star.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbUNIVERSE SLIME can destroy various objects such as buildings by jumping and stomping.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbBy destroying buildings, UNIVERSE SLIME swallows rubble and grows larger. Universe Slime can also swallow objects smaller than itself without destroying them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbThe goal of this game is to grow UNIVERSE SLIME and reach the sun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story begins on Earth, on the verge of being swallowed by the Sun due to its gravitational collapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The UNIVERSE SLIME, a remnant of a star, grows larger and larger with each substance it swallows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first it can only swallow small objects, but through repeated destruction it will swallow buildings and cities, eventually growing large enough to swallow the Sun and save the solar system.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3872640?t=1774147862","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3872640?t=1774147862","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872640/336e8d3fe40e3accdebf854e2bc9f76040dce406/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774147862","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872640/336e8d3fe40e3accdebf854e2bc9f76040dce406/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774147862","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3916240,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UNIVERSE SLIME is a destruction action game where everything is destructible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbThe player controls a UNIVERSE SLIME, a remnant of a star.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbUNIVERSE SLIME can destroy various objects such as buildings by jumping and stomping.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbBy destroying buildings, UNIVERSE SLIME swallows rubble and grows larger. Universe Slime can also swallow objects smaller than itself without destroying them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbThe goal of this game is to grow UNIVERSE SLIME and reach the sun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story begins on Earth, on the verge of being swallowed by the Sun due to its gravitational collapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The UNIVERSE SLIME, a remnant of a star, grows larger and larger with each substance it swallows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first it can only swallow small objects, but through repeated destruction it will swallow buildings and cities, eventually growing large enough to swallow the Sun and save the solar system.</p>","developers":["Mash Potato"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872640/eec9e2de29c4dde1fa0982fd69592066a5520682/header.jpg?t=1774147862","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3872640/1110086382/526a99caa24ddfce8ee32eeae7ce2931a6f688ba/1752172034/dash_av1.mpd?t=1752704453","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3872640/1110086382/526a99caa24ddfce8ee32eeae7ce2931a6f688ba/1752172034/dash_h264.mpd?t=1752704453","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3872640/1110086382